/-- **the AM seven-point certificate**: the half-space certificate completed by reflection (symmetric weights) -/
theorem AMS02_cert_full : ∀ x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 : ℝ, 0 ≤ x0 → 0 ≤ x1 → 0 ≤ x2 → 0 ≤ x3 → 0 ≤ x4 → 0 ≤ x5 →
